 (text "Main switch: 3 x IRFB7430 high side, MIC5014, precharge, E-stop AND" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "7048098a-4374-5e20-b5ad-aa6176309cea"))
(text "MIC5014 (DS20006767A): V+ 2.75-30 V (60 V abs, gate off above 35 V), IN TTL 0.8/2.0 V, ~1 uA, gate clamped" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "58be13a5-f5b9-5982-895b-ef5bef3f558c"))
(text "13-17 V above SOURCE. V+ straight from BAT (SOURCE = VM must not exceed V+), 10 uF + 100 nF at pins 1/4." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "3f14bb46-5350-5b64-87a9-db7017427b4e"))
(text "Turn-on: 1 nF in 90 us at 12 V; 3 x 300 nC -> about 5 ms (VM already precharged). Turn-off: 1 nF in 6 us;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "b8c6b8ad-ddbf-5ead-99be-6630751d03f1"))
(text "estimate 0.1-0.4 ms for 0.9-1.2 uC incl. Miller: about 0.04 J per FET at 90 A, inside the SOA. BENCH CHECK." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "2bb6a567-a9d4-55e2-8bee-95167f55b7ea"))
(text "10 Ohm per gate (sharing, damping), 100k G-S keeps the FETs off with the MIC5014 out of its socket." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "6bd8080d-9255-53bb-95d2-e52b0def42e5"))
(text "Precharge: IRF9Z34N + MF-R050 + 10 Ohm 5 W into VM; tau 20 ms for 2 mF, 0.28 J per start. The MF-R050" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "7ef6b01f-82ce-55cb-9334-69b667c70120"))
(text "trips (1 A, seconds) if precharge is left on into a shorted bus (28 W in the resistor otherwise)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "1e4c3366-f3f9-50c1-a030-db4e4d12e1a5"))
(text "E-stop in hardware: 74HCT08 at 5 V: MIC_IN = MAIN_EN AND ESTOP_OK; precharge = PRECHARGE_EN AND ESTOP_OK." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "1b865bb8-8fb5-557b-bc0d-77625f4ebacb"))
(text "Pico enables have 100k pull-downs, so a Pico reset opens the switch. VM TVS 1.5KE22A (18.8 V standoff)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 73.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "7092e3bf-fec4-57f4-b96e-61777c82bd68"))
